---
/**
 * Preloads the banner image. Must sit BEFORE the stylesheets: the banner is a
 * CSS background, so the browser cannot discover it until colors.css parses,
 * and it is the largest thing on the first screen.
 */
---
<!--The banner is a CSS background, so the browser cannot find it until
        colors.css has been parsed. It is the largest thing on the first screen,
        so tell it up front.-->
    <link rel="preload" href="../images/banner-images/banner_wide.webp" as="image" />

    